<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - KCS Energy said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KCS Energy said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- KCS Energy Inc was cut to neutral from an outperform by Smith Barney, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Tuesday at 34-1/2.</p>
<p>-- The company said on on Monday that a jury said it must pay Tenneco Inc's Tennessee Gas Pipeline Co $143.2m illion in litigation concerning alleged enrichment by KCS of natural gas sold to Tenneco.</p>
</text>
